# TASK/LDG-M3-B1 acceptance (LDGDEMO.NAP, WinDom client) -- the m3c script of
# measurement-2026-10-06-ldg-m3 with step 3 changed: the SHORT click on
# Compute now has to work (B1). Window geometry as there:
#   Compute (236..303, 259..278)  Close (331..400, 259..278)
# Ticks hz_200 after the client's first poll. IKBD: Alt 38, C 2E, Return 1C,
# Esc 01, '1' 02, '2' 03, '3' 04; break = make | 0x80.
#  1. Alt+C -> compute() -> FormAlert(mathinfo()) (keyboard path); Return.
#  2. LONG press on Compute (0.8 s): same alert (mouse path, as before); Return.
#  3. SHORT click on Compute (30 ms, inside the double-click window): the
#     same alert must appear now (EV_MB = 1, B1); Return closes it.
#  4. Esc 1 2 3 into the Value field (objc_edit; caret placement = O1).
#  5. Return = DEFAULT Close -> exit(0) -> back on the desktop.
100 parkbr
